1	//! Extension of ERC-1155 that adds tracking of total supply per token id.
2	//!
3	//! Useful for scenarios where Fungible and Non-fungible tokens have to be
4	//! clearly identified. Note: While a `total_supply` of 1 might mean the
5	//! corresponding is an NFT, there are no guarantees that no other tokens
6	//! with the same id are not going to be minted.
7	//!
8	//! NOTE: This contract implies a global limit of 2**256 - 1 to the number
9	//! of tokens that can be minted.
10	//!
11	//! CAUTION: This extension should not be added in an upgrade to an already
12	//! deployed contract.
